        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mar is a first person low quality small horror game where your only task is to escape monster by searching for specific items to escape each location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features several maps ranging from underground dungeons and dreamy like place. Your objective is to collect 5 specific items in each place to unlock your way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monster's task is to hunt you down and prevent you from escaping so make sure that you aren't in its way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is designed to give a old-school gameplay style with low quality environment and some camera effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814530/extras/a518928401fa493b0b7ada52de21f895.avif?t=1773959170\" alt=\"Human\" width=325 height=511 /></span></p>",
